    {
      "source": "<code>parameter</code> - the method parameter",
      "translation": "<code>parameter</code> - 方法参数",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "If the method parameter type is <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>, the name specified in the\nannotation is used to resolve the URI variable String value. The value is\nthen converted to a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a> via type conversion, assuming a suitable\n<a href=\"../../../../../core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果方法参数类型为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>，则使用注解中指定的名称来解析 URI 变量 String 值。然后通过类型转换将该值转换为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/util/Map.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.util\"><code>Map</code></a>，前提是存在合适的 <a href=\"../../../../../core/convert/converter/Converter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.core.convert.converter\"><code>Converter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "An @<a href=\"../../../../bind/annotation/PathVariable.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.web.bind.annotation\"><code>PathVariable</code></a> is a named value that gets resolved from a URI\ntemplate variable. It is always required and does not have a default value\nto fall back on. See the base class\n<a href=\"../../../../method/annotation/AbstractNamedValueMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.method.annotation\"><code>AbstractNamedValueMethodArgumentResolver</code></a>\nfor more information on how named values are processed.",
      "translation": "`@<a href=\"../../../../bind/annotation/PathVariable.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.web.bind.annotation\"><code>PathVariable</code></a>` 是一个从 URI 模板变量解析出的命名值。它总是必需的，且没有默认值作为后备。有关如何处理命名值的更多信息，请参阅基类\n<a href=\"../../../../method/annotation/AbstractNamedValueMethodArgumentResolver.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.method.annotation\"><code>AbstractNamedValueMethodArgumentResolver</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
